## Verification
- Sound quality and oscillator detuning behaviors verified.
- Sequencer timing aligns with audio context hardware clock for jitter-free playback.
- UI validated in browser for both layout consistency and proper DOM binding to audio parameters. No overlapping modules or console errors.

To launch the dev server again, run:
```bash
npm run dev
```
